  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: every render formats the whole document. Parsed source is no longer written back byte for byte (encoding, BOM and the dominant newline are kept; whitespace, indentation and blank lines come from the formatter). Comments belong to nodes and move, survive and are removed with them; parsed multi-line comment text is dedented. Every checked render reads its output back and refuses output that does not mean the model (EMIT001). New RenderOptions.Newline and MaxLineLength; SortUsings also sorts parsed documents; Reformat is obsolete and returns its input (removed in 0.8.0); FORMAT001 is reported for every opaque node. See the README for details and the remaining known limitations.",
